      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUBY SHINE (1) has a strong record this trip including two wins from four starts. Comes off a (25.41) win last time, scoring by 2.25 lengths in a Grade 5 over 457m at this track. Looks the one to beat with even luck. LAKODA BONNIE (5) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at Capalaba in a handy 19.69 beating Three Girls. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. In sparkling form with a string of wins and can measure up again. TICKLE DRAGON (2) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (17.17) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Capalaba. Can hit the frame this time. UNIQUE REWARD (3) was strongly fancied last time on the back of a win two back but could only manage fourth (30.33) at Q Parklands.",
